  "paragraphs": [
    [
      "P001",
      "SAFETY",
      false,
      "heading",
      "13:column:0",
      null,
      []
    ],
    [
      "P002",
      "2.2. Intended use",
      false,
      "heading",
      "13:column:0",
      null,
      [
        "S001"
      ]
    ],
    [
      "P003",
      "• The pump (set) must only be operated within the operating limits described in the other\napplicable documents.",
      false,
      "prose",
      "13:column:0",
      null,
      [
        "S002"
      ]
    ],
    [
      "P004",
      "• Only operate pumps / pump sets which are in perfect technical condition.",
      false,
      "prose",
      "13:column:0",
      null,
      [
        "S002"
      ]
    ],
    [
      "P005",
      "• Do not operate the pump (set) in partially assembled condition.",
      false,
      "prose",
      "13:column:0",
      null,
      [
        "S002"
      ]
    ],
    [
      "P006",
      "• Only use the pump to handle the fluids described in the order or product literature of the pump\nmodel or variant.",
      false,
      "prose",
      "13:column:0",
      null,
      [
        "S002"
      ]
    ],
    [
      "P007",
      "• Never operate the pump without the fluid to be handled.",
      false,
      "prose",
      "13:column:0",
      null,
      [
        "S002"
      ]
    ],
    [
      "P008",
      "• Observe the information on minimum flow rates specified in the product literature (to prevent\noverheating, bearing damage, etc.).",
      false,
      "prose",
      "13:column:0",
      null,
      [
        "S002"
      ]
    ],
    [
      "P009",
      "• Observe the information on maximum flow rates specified in the product literature (to prevent\noverheating, mechanical seal damage, cavitation damage, bearing damage, etc.).",
      false,
      "prose",
      "13:column:0",
      null,
      [
        "S002"
      ]
    ],
    [
      "P010",
      "• Do not throttle the flow rate on the suction side of the pump (to prevent cavitation damage).",
      false,
      "prose",
      "13:column:0",
      null,
      [
        "S002"
      ]
    ],
    [
      "P011",
      "• Consult the manufacturer about any other modes of operation not described in the product\nliterature.",
      false,
      "prose",
      "13:column:0",
      null,
      [
        "S002"
      ]
    ],
    [
      "P012",
      "Prevention of foreseeable misuse\n• Never open the discharge-side shut-off elements further than permitted.",
      false,
      "prose",
      "13:column:0",
      null,
      [
        "S002"
      ]
    ],
    [
      "P013",
      "- The maximum flow rate specified in the technical product literature would be exceeded.",
      false,
      "prose",
      "13:column:0",
      null,
      [
        "S002"
      ]
    ],
    [
      "P014",
      "- Risk of cavitation damage\n• Never exceed the permissible operating limits (pressure, temperature, etc.) specified in the\nproduct literature.",
      false,
      "prose",
      "13:column:0",
      null,
      [
        "S002"
      ]
    ],
    [
      "P015",
      "• Observe all safety information and instructions in this manual.",
      false,
      "prose",
      "13:column:0",
      null,
      [
        "S002"
      ]
    ],
    [
      "P016",
      "DESMI Pumping Technology A/S\nTagholm 1",
      false,
      "prose",
      "13:column:0",
      null,
      [
        "S002"
      ]
    ],
    [
      "P017",
      "9400 Nørresundby – Denmark\nTlf. nr.: +45 96 32 81 11\nFax +45 98 17 54 99\n12\nE-mail: desmi@desmi.com www.desmi.com",
      false,
      "prose",
      "13:column:0",
      null,
      [
        "S002"
      ]
    ],
    [
      "P018",
      "SAFETY",
      true,
      "heading",
      "14:column:0",
      null,
      []
    ],
    [
      "P019",
      "2.3. Consequences and risks caused by non-compliance with this",
      true,
      "heading",
      "14:column:0",
      null,
      [
        "S003"
      ]
    ],
    [
      "P020",
      "manual\n• Non-compliance with this manual will lead to forfeiture of warranty cover and of any and all\nrights to claims for damages.",
      true,
      "prose",
      "14:column:0",
      null,
      [
        "S004"
      ]
    ],
    [
      "P021",
      "• Non-compliance can, for example, have the following consequences:\n- Hazards to persons due to electrical, thermal, mechanical and chemical effects and\nexplosions\n- Failure of important product functions\n- Failure of prescribed maintenance and servicing practices\n- Hazard to the environment due to leakage of hazardous substances.",
      true,
      "prose",
      "14:column:0",
      null,
      [
        "S004"
      ]
    ],
    [
      "P022",
      "2.4. Safety awareness",
      true,
      "heading",
      "14:column:0",
      null,
      [
        "S004"
      ]
    ],
    [
      "P023",
      "In addition to the safety information contained in this manual and the intended use, the following\nsafety regulations shall be complied with:\n• Accident prevention, health and safety regulations\n• Explosion protection regulations\n• Safety regulations for handling hazardous substances\n• Applicable standards, directives and laws",
      true,
      "prose",
      "14:column:0",
      null,
      [
        "S005"
      ]
    ],
    [
      "P024",
      "2.5. Safety information for the operator/user",
      true,
      "heading",
      "14:column:0",
      null,
      [
        "S005"
      ]
    ],
    [
      "P025",
      "• The operator shall fit contact guards for hot, cold and moving parts and check that the guards\nfunction properly.",
      true,
      "prose",
      "14:column:0",
      null,
      [
        "S006"
      ]
    ],
    [
      "P026",
      "• Do not remove any contact guards during operation.",
      true,
      "prose",
      "14:column:0",
      null,
      [
        "S006"
      ]
    ],
    [
      "P027",
      "• Provide the personnel with protective equipment and make sure it is used.",
      true,
      "prose",
      "14:column:0",
      null,
      [
        "S006"
      ]
    ],
    [
      "P028",
      "• Contain leakages (e.g. at the shaft seal) of hazardous fluids handled (e.g. explosive, toxic, hot)\nso as to avoid any danger to persons and the environment.",
      true,
      "prose",
      "14:column:0",
      null,
      [
        "S006"
      ]
    ],
    [
      "P029",
      "Adhere to all relevant laws.",
      true,
      "prose",
      "14:column:0",
      null,
      [
        "S006"
      ]
    ],
    [
      "P030",
      "• Eliminate all electrical hazards. (In this respect, refer to applicable national safety regulations\nand/or regulations issued by the local energy supply companies.)\n• If shutting down the pump does not increase potential risk, fit an emergency stop control\ndevice in the immediate vicinity of the pump (set) during pump set installation.",
      true,
      "prose",
      "14:column:0",
      null,
      [
        "S006"
      ]
    ],
    [
      "P031",
      "DESMI Pumping Technology A/S\nTagholm 1",
      true,
      "prose",
      "14:column:0",
      null,
      [
        "S006"
      ]
    ],
    [
      "P032",
      "9400 Nørresundby – Denmark\nTlf. nr.: +45 96 32 81 11\nFax +45 98 17 54 99\n13\nE-mail: desmi@desmi.com www.desmi.com",
      true,
      "prose",
